IELTS.lesson({"test": 1, "part": 1, "title": "Test 1, Part 1 — the interview", "candidate": "lama", "script": [{"who": "examiner", "text": "Good morning. Come in, have a seat.", "ar": "صباح الخير. تفضّلي بالدخول واجلسي.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/1b2def3fa2b0b362.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "My name is Mohamad Khorbatli. Can you tell me your full name, please?", "ar": "اسمي محمد خرباطلي. هل يمكنكِ أن تخبريني باسمكِ الكامل من فضلك؟", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/c756d0707f344069.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Lama Haddad.", "ar": "لمى حداد.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/0d7312088795a6db.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "And what can I call you?", "ar": "وبماذا أناديكِ؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5085ae49113e09cf.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Lama is fine.", "ar": "لمى تكفي.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a0672b143bf95927.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you, Lama. Can I see your identification, please?", "ar": "شكراً لكِ يا لمى. هل يمكنني رؤية هويتكِ من فضلك؟", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/659aa2a537d88889.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Of course. Here you are.", "ar": "بالتأكيد. تفضّل.", "shot": null, "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/bd2e669f1f8fe87e.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. That's all fine.", "ar": "شكراً. كل شيء على ما يرام.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a65ff8d3eccec277.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Now, in this first part I'd like to ask you some questions about yourself. Let's talk about where you live.", "ar": "الآن، في هذا القسم الأول أودّ أن أسألكِ بعض الأسئلة عن نفسكِ. لنتحدّث عن المكان الذي تسكنين فيه.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/8345fff4b4c5c78d.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Do you live in a house or a flat?", "ar": "هل تسكنين في منزل أم في شقة؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/4e0021e9a9efcb9c.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I live in a flat in Qanawat, which is in the old part of Damascus. We're on the third floor and there's no lift. The ceilings are very high, so the rooms look nice but they're really cold in winter.", "ar": "أسكن في شقة في القنوات، وهي في الجزء القديم من دمشق. نحن في الطابق الثالث ولا يوجد مصعد. الأسقف عالية جداً، فتبدو الغرف جميلة لكنها باردة جداً في الشتاء.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/bd8b5b831c63cbe5.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "What do you like most about living there?", "ar": "ما أكثر ما يعجبكِ في السكن هناك؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/d2eb71d67f13707e.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Well, I like that I can walk everywhere. The shops and the souk are about fifteen minutes away, so I don't need a taxi. Honestly, after four years here it's strange to wait for one.", "ar": "حسناً، يعجبني أنني أستطيع المشي إلى كل مكان. المحلات والسوق على بعد خمس عشرة دقيقة تقريباً، فلا أحتاج إلى سيارة أجرة. بصراحة، بعد أربع سنوات هنا صار الانتظار غريباً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/07525a4a5f6acecd.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Is there anything you would change about it?", "ar": "هل هناك شيء تودّين تغييره فيه؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5567ba5c8388210a.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I'd change the noise, to be honest. We're above a busy street in Qanawat and it starts at six in the morning. But that's the price of living in the centre, so I don't complain much.", "ar": "كنت أغيّر الضجيج، بصراحة. نحن فوق شارع مزدحم في القنوات ويبدأ عند السادسة صباحاً. لكن هذا ثمن السكن في المركز، فلا أشتكي كثيراً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/cb7e1550cfb01a18.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "And do you think you'll live in the same area in ten years?", "ar": "وهل تعتقدين أنكِ ستسكنين في المنطقة نفسها بعد عشر سنوات؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/ba56809f5fcd694d.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I hope so, because I really like the area. It's going to depend on my work, though. If I get a job in a hospital on the other side of Damascus, I'll probably have to move closer to it.", "ar": "أتمنى ذلك، لأن المنطقة تعجبني كثيراً. لكن الأمر سيعتمد على عملي. إذا حصلتُ على وظيفة في مستشفى في الطرف الآخر من دمشق، فسأضطر غالباً إلى الانتقال قريباً منه.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/d1ca8296f74e3c8e.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Let's move on to talk about studying.", "ar": "لننتقل الآن للحديث عن الدراسة.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/37289c640b957079.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "What are you studying at the moment?", "ar": "ماذا تدرسين حالياً؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/4a4d5a613c2664b1.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I'm studying medicine, and I'm in my fourth year at Damascus University, which means three mornings a week I'm at the teaching hospital and the rest of the time I'm in lectures. So it's quite a full week.", "ar": "أدرس الطب، وأنا في السنة الرابعة في جامعة دمشق، ما يعني أنني ثلاثة صباحات في الأسبوع في المشفى التعليمي وبقية الوقت في المحاضرات. فالأسبوع مزدحم فعلاً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a054d0cd2e56ad14.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Why did you choose that subject?", "ar": "لماذا اخترتِ هذا الاختصاص؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/0b9cb7c2c4d93fcf.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Well, there wasn't one big reason. I was good at biology at school, and my aunt is a children's doctor, so I spent a lot of holidays helping in her clinic in Damascus. After that it just felt normal.", "ar": "حسناً، لم يكن هناك سبب واحد كبير. كنتُ جيدة في علم الأحياء في المدرسة، وخالتي طبيبة أطفال، فقضيتُ عطلاً كثيرة أساعد في عيادتها في دمشق. بعد ذلك بدا الأمر طبيعياً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/952124646cffe81a.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Do you prefer studying alone or with other people?", "ar": "هل تفضّلين الدراسة وحدكِ أم مع آخرين؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/e9deee17e4dd909f.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I prefer to study alone, actually, because I can't concentrate when someone's talking. But before an exam at the university I want a friend to ask me questions out loud. I need to hear myself say the answer.", "ar": "أفضّل الدراسة وحدي في الحقيقة، لأنني لا أستطيع التركيز حين يتكلم أحد. لكن قبل الامتحان في الجامعة أريد صديقة تسألني أسئلة بصوت عالٍ. أحتاج أن أسمع نفسي أقول الجواب.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a053ded2656581fc.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "What's the hardest part of your studies?", "ar": "ما أصعب جزء في دراستكِ؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/2b898bbad2e08651.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Honestly, the speed is the hard part. You learn something well on Monday, and by Thursday there's three new things. I'd say you never really feel ready at the hospital, and you have to accept that.", "ar": "بصراحة، السرعة هي الجزء الصعب. تتعلّمين شيئاً جيداً يوم الاثنين، وبحلول الخميس تكون هناك ثلاثة أشياء جديدة. أقول إنكِ لا تشعرين أبداً بالاستعداد في المشفى، وعليكِ أن تتقبّلي ذلك.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/9dbaaf132a2758d8.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Finally in this part, let's talk about sleep.", "ar": "وأخيراً في هذا القسم، لنتحدّث عن النوم.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/7519552f9395e06e.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "How many hours do you usually sleep?", "ar": "كم ساعة تنامين عادة؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a0aa7996a76a1b1e.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "About six hours, usually. My mother says it isn't enough, and she's probably right. When I've got a week at the hospital it's even less, so I'm always tired by Thursday.", "ar": "ست ساعات تقريباً، عادةً. تقول أمي إنها ليست كافية، وهي محقّة على الأرجح. وحين يكون لديّ أسبوع في المشفى تكون أقلّ، فأكون متعبة دائماً بحلول الخميس.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/e579b277ed973098.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Do you ever take a nap during the day?", "ar": "هل تأخذين قيلولة خلال النهار أحياناً؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/b9814e4501dcf771.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Yes, quite often, actually. I'll sleep for twenty minutes in the hospital library between a shift and a lecture, because everyone there does it and nobody's going to say anything about it.", "ar": "نعم، كثيراً في الحقيقة. أنام عشرين دقيقة في مكتبة المشفى بين مناوبة ومحاضرة، لأن الجميع هناك يفعل ذلك ولن يقول أحد شيئاً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/cb5aa8356a01ebda.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Has the amount you sleep changed in recent years?", "ar": "هل تغيّرت ساعات نومكِ في السنوات الأخيرة؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/93544316d1cb7c9f.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "It's less regular now, I'd say. Going to bed at midnight every night would be fine. The problem is that one night I sleep at nine and the next night at two, and that's what makes me tired at the hospital.", "ar": "صارت أقلّ انتظاماً الآن، على ما أعتقد. النوم عند منتصف الليل كل ليلة سيكون جيداً. المشكلة أنني ليلةً أنام عند التاسعة والليلة التالية عند الثانية، وهذا ما يتعبني في المشفى.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/d96a1aa705cad6ca.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "And do you think people today sleep less than in the past?", "ar": "وهل تعتقدين أن الناس اليوم ينامون أقلّ من الماضي؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/b1dfdba5cb65cafc.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Probably, but it depends who you're comparing them with. My grandmother got up at five every morning all her life, and nobody here called that a problem. Her day just started early and it didn't finish late.", "ar": "على الأرجح، لكن الأمر يعتمد على من نقارنهم به. كانت جدّتي تستيقظ عند الخامسة كل صباح طوال حياتها، ولم يسمِّ أحد هنا ذلك مشكلة. كان يومها يبدأ باكراً ولا ينتهي متأخراً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/0ca498c30d063998.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. That is the end of Part One.", "ar": "شكراً لكِ. بهذا ينتهي القسم الأول.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/50f379466faf1658.mp3"}], "boxes": [{"q": "Let's talk about where you live. Do you live in a house or a flat?", "ar": null, "topic": "Home and where you live", "model": "I live in a flat in Qanawat, which is in the old part of Damascus. We're on the third floor and there's no lift. The ceilings are very high, so the rooms look nice but they're really cold in winter.", "why": "Answer, gloss for the examiner, specific, then a reversal. The 'which' clauses are doing the complex-sentence work without effort."}, {"q": "What do you like most about living there?", "ar": null, "topic": "Home and where you live", "model": "Well, I like that I can walk everywhere. The shops and the souk are about fifteen minutes away, so I don't need a taxi. Honestly, after four years here it's strange to wait for one.", "why": "A reason, then a number, then a consequence. 'Honestly' and 'so' are doing the work that an idiom used to do - at band 7 the shape carries the answer, not the vocabulary."}, {"q": "Is there anything you would change about it?", "ar": null, "topic": "Home and where you live", "model": "I'd change the noise, to be honest. We're above a busy street in Qanawat and it starts at six in the morning. But that's the price of living in the centre, so I don't complain much.", "why": "Concedes the trade-off instead of only complaining. 'To be honest' and 'but that's the price of' are ordinary phrases placed well, which is the band-7 move."}, {"q": "Do you think you'll live in the same area in ten years?", "ar": null, "topic": "Home and where you live", "model": "I hope so, because I really like the area. It's going to depend on my work, though. If I get a job in a hospital on the other side of Damascus, I'll probably have to move closer to it.", "why": "Commits, then qualifies with a condition. The 'if' clause is the complex sentence, and it is doing real work rather than decorating the answer."}, {"q": "What are you studying at the moment?", "ar": null, "topic": "Studying", "model": "I'm studying medicine, and I'm in my fourth year at Damascus University, which means three mornings a week I'm at the teaching hospital and the rest of the time I'm in lectures. So it's quite a full week.", "why": "One fact, then what it means in practice, then a summary of the week. The 'which means' clause is the only subordination needed and the rest is plain."}, {"q": "Why did you choose that subject?", "ar": null, "topic": "Studying", "model": "Well, there wasn't one big reason. I was good at biology at school, and my aunt is a children's doctor, so I spent a lot of holidays helping in her clinic in Damascus. After that it just felt normal.", "why": "Refuses the single big reason and gives two small real ones instead. 'After that it just felt normal' closes without reaching for an image."}, {"q": "Do you prefer studying alone or with other people?", "ar": null, "topic": "Studying", "model": "I prefer to study alone, actually, because I can't concentrate when someone's talking. But before an exam at the university I want a friend to ask me questions out loud. I need to hear myself say the answer.", "why": "A two-part answer from a two-part question, and the last clause is a genuine self-observation rather than a general claim."}, {"q": "What's the hardest part of your studies?", "ar": null, "topic": "Studying", "model": "Honestly, the speed is the hard part. You learn something well on Monday, and by Thursday there's three new things. I'd say you never really feel ready at the hospital, and you have to accept that.", "why": "Names the difficulty, then proves it with two days of the week rather than with an adjective. 'Honestly' and 'I'd say' are the markers, and the answer ends by accepting the problem instead of solving it."}, {"q": "How many hours do you usually sleep?", "ar": null, "topic": "Sleep", "model": "About six hours, usually. My mother says it isn't enough, and she's probably right. When I've got a week at the hospital it's even less, so I'm always tired by Thursday.", "why": "Answers with a number, concedes the obvious objection, then adds a specific. Short sentences and one contrast - the three-beat shape at its plainest."}, {"q": "Do you ever take a nap during the day?", "ar": null, "topic": "Sleep", "model": "Yes, quite often, actually. I'll sleep for twenty minutes in the hospital library between a shift and a lecture, because everyone there does it and nobody's going to say anything about it.", "why": "Says yes, then explains where and why, with a reason that is about other people rather than about herself. 'Quite often, actually' is the marker a band-7 speaker really uses."}, {"q": "Has the amount you sleep changed in recent years?", "ar": null, "topic": "Sleep", "model": "It's less regular now, I'd say. Going to bed at midnight every night would be fine. The problem is that one night I sleep at nine and the next night at two, and that's what makes me tired at the hospital.", "why": "Names the real problem - irregularity, not quantity - and gives the two times that make it. The contrast is carried by 'the problem is that', not by a built phrase."}, {"q": "Do you think people today sleep less than in the past?", "ar": null, "topic": "Sleep", "model": "Probably, but it depends who you're comparing them with. My grandmother got up at five every morning all her life, and nobody here called that a problem. Her day just started early and it didn't finish late.", "why": "QUALIFY appearing in Part 1. The counter-example does the arguing, and there is no date or number in it to go stale."}], "voices": {"examiner": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "candidate": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119"}});
